//? Title: Todd-Coxeter: actual coset definitions, coincidences and closure
//? Subtitle: Actual canonical histories, retained original fixtures and explicit controls
//? Exports: both
//? Lang: en-GB

\abstract(
Coset enumeration builds a generator action from a group presentation and
subgroup constraints. Actual definitions, scan deductions and coincidence merges
retain the original cyclic, dihedral and triangle-group examples while making
unresolved resource limits explicit.
)

\toc

> Mechanism and mathematical scope

Each table row is a coset and paired columns are a generator and inverse. Scan a
relator forward and backward from one row: an isolated gap determines a link, a
larger gap defines a row, and incompatible endpoints imply a coincidence. Merge
the coincidence congruence iteratively across every generator direction.
Subgroup words fix row0. Repeated complete scan/fill passes continue until no
actual links, definitions or merges change and every surviving row is complete.
No general polynomial bound or successful-termination guarantee exists; a
resource-limited index-1 is unresolved and does not prove infinite order/index.

> A tiny actual producing history

The table and native concept diagram read the same producing execution. Every
block below is a complete editable C++ program.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/todd_coxeter_tiny.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main() {
    namespace a = dm::algorithms;
    namespace g = dm::graphics;
    std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
    auto r = a::todd_coxeter_trace(1, {{1, 1, 1}}, {});
    std::print("| actual action | row | other | internal symbol | ever defined | live | actual scanned word " "|\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | --- |\n");
    for (const auto &s : r.steps)
        std::print("| {} | {} | {} | {} | {} | {} | `{}` |\n", s.action,
                   s.coset, s.other, s.symbol, s.defined, s.live, s.word);
    std::print("Closed {}; actual compact action `{}`.\n", r.closed,
               r.compact_table);
    g::Diagram concept_diagram(48, 1100);
    concept_diagram.node("n0", {0, 0}, "Actual presentation a^3=identity");
    concept_diagram.node("n1", {5, 0},
                         std::format("{} actual row definitions", r.definitions));
    concept_diagram.node("n2", {10, 0},
                         std::format("Actual closed index {}", r.index));
    concept_diagram.edge("n0", "n1").edge("n1", "n2");
    concept_diagram.save_svg("build/todd_coxeter_tiny.svg");
}
```
